LKina — Licensing Overview
==========================

LKina is a dual-licensed C++ project:

1. Files derived from AutoDock Vina 1.2.7 retain their original
   **Apache License 2.0** terms. See `LICENSE.Apache-2.0`.

2. Files written with reference to AutoGrid 4.2 — specifically:

       src/lib/ag4_engine.cpp
       src/lib/ag4_engine.h
       src/lib/embedded_ad4_grid.cpp
       src/lib/embedded_ad4_grid.h
       src/lib/ad4_parameter_data.cpp
       src/lib/ad4_parameter_data.h

   — are licensed under the **GNU General Public License, version 3
   or any later version** (GPL-3.0-or-later). See `LICENSE` for the full
   GPL-3.0 text. AutoGrid 4.2 upstream is licensed under GPL-2.0-or-later,
   which permits upgrading to GPL-3.0.

Because the GPL-3.0 files are linked together with the Apache-2.0 Vina
core into a single binary, the **combined LKina executable as a whole
is distributed under the GNU General Public License, version 3** (as
permitted by Apache-2.0 being compatible with GPL-3.0, per the FSF
license compatibility matrix).

File map
--------

    LICENSE              Full text of GPL-3.0 (primary distribution license)
    LICENSE.Apache-2.0   Full text of Apache License 2.0 (Vina-origin files)
    COPYING              This file (dual-license scope and file map)
    NOTICE               Upstream copyright, attribution and modification log

